@startuml seq_1_registration
title Flow 1 – User Registration & Email Verification

skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #1A237E
    ActorBorderColor #1565C0
    ActorBackgroundColor #E3F2FD
    ParticipantBorderColor #4527A0
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #EDE7F6
    DatabaseBorderColor #2E7D32
    DatabaseBackgroundColor #E8F5E9
    LifeLineBorderColor #AAAAAA
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #F8F9FC
    NoteBackgroundColor #FFF9C4
    NoteBorderColor #F9A825
}
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8

actor       "User"                  as user
participant "Blazor Server"         as blazor
database    "PostgreSQL\n(Supabase)" as pg
participant "Supabase Auth API"     as supaauth #FBE9E7
participant "User's Email Inbox"    as inbox    #FBE9E7

== Registration ==

user    ->  blazor    : Fill & submit Register form
blazor  ->  pg        : FindByEmailAsync() + check username
pg      --> blazor    : Not found — OK to proceed
blazor  ->  blazor    : Hash password\n(Identity PasswordHasher)
blazor  ->  pg        : INSERT PendingRegistration\n(email, displayName, passwordHash, expiresAt)
pg      --> blazor    : Saved
blazor  ->  supaauth  : SignUpAsync(email, password, confirmUrl)
supaauth -> inbox     : Send confirmation email (magic link)
supaauth --> blazor   : 200 OK
blazor  --> user      : Show "Check your inbox" screen

== User clicks confirmation link in email ==

user    ->  blazor    : GET /auth/do-signin?token_hash=…
blazor  ->  supaauth  : VerifyTokenHashAsync(token_hash, "email")
supaauth --> blazor   : Return verified email address
blazor  ->  pg        : SELECT PendingRegistration WHERE email = ?
pg      --> blazor    : Return pending record + passwordHash
blazor  ->  pg        : INSERT AspNetUsers\n(EmailConfirmed = true, restore PasswordHash)
blazor  ->  pg        : DELETE PendingRegistration
blazor  ->  blazor    : SignInAsync() — write auth cookie
blazor  --> user      : Redirect to /  (logged in)

@enduml
